---
const { catalog, lab, role } = Astro.props;
const roles = catalog.roles;
const organizations = [...new Set(roles.map(r => r.organization))];
---
<div class="ic" id="ic-content">
  <nav class="ic-top" aria-label="Intern navigation"><a class="ic-wordmark" href="/">POINTCAST<span> / INTERN</span></a><div><a href="/intern/#ic-roles">Role library</a><a href="/intern/#cl-experiments">Learning lab</a><a href="/intern.json">JSON</a></div></nav>
  {role ? <>
    <header class="ic-detail-head"><a href="/intern/#ic-roles">← Role library</a><p class="ic-label">FILE {role.number} / {role.organization}</p><h1>{role.title}</h1><p class="ic-lede">{role.summary}</p><span class="ic-status">{role.statusLabel}</span></header>
    <aside class="ic-notice"><strong>Historical description<br/><span class="ic-small">{role.descriptionLabel}</span></strong><p>{role.statusNote} PointCast republishes this description as a reference; it does not represent an offer of employment.</p></aside>
    <div class="ic-detail"><article class="ic-description"><p class="ic-label">01 / The description</p>{role.sections.map(s=><section><h2>{s.heading}</h2>{s.paragraphs?.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}{s.items?.length>0&&<ul>{s.items.map(i=><li>{i}</li>)}</ul>}</section>)}
      <section><h2>Application status</h2><p>{role.applicationNote}</p></section>
    </article><aside class="ic-facts"><p class="ic-label">02 / Source card</p><dl><dt>Original organization</dt><dd>{role.organization}</dd><dt>Source date</dt><dd>{role.sourceDateLabel}</dd><dt>Description checked</dt><dd>{catalog.verifiedAt}</dd><dt>Opening status</dt><dd>{role.statusLabel}</dd></dl><p>{role.sourceNote}</p><p class="ic-small">“Description checked” records source review. It does not verify a current vacancy.</p>{role.sourceUrl&&<a href={role.sourceUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">Original public source ↗</a>}<a href={`/intern/roles/${role.slug}.json`}>This role record as JSON ↗</a></aside></div>
    <section class="ic-section"><p class="ic-label">03 / Next cartridge</p><div class="ic-neighbors">{roles.filter(r=>r.slug!==role.slug).slice(0,3).map(r=><a href={`/intern/roles/${r.slug}/`}><span>{r.number} / {r.organization}</span>{r.title}<small>{r.statusLabel} ↗</small></a>)}</div></section>
  </> : <>
    <header class="ic-hero"><div><p class="ic-label">REFERENCE SYSTEM / EDITION 2026.10</p><h1>A place to<br/>begin.</h1><p class="ic-lede">Internship descriptions from the archive. Small experiments for what comes next.</p><div class="ic-actions"><a href="#ic-roles">01 / Browse the roles <span>↓</span></a><a href="#cl-experiments">02 / Enter the lab <span>↓</span></a></div></div><div class="ic-console" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ic-console-label">POINTCAST<br/><span>INTERN SYSTEM</span></div><div class="ic-slots"><i>01</i><i>02</i><i>03</i><i>04</i></div><div class="ic-controller"><div class="ic-cross"></div><div class="ic-keypad">{Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=><b>{i<9?i+1:i===9?'*':i===10?'0':'#'}</b>)}</div></div><div class="ic-console-foot"><span>READ / EXPLORE / MAKE</span><span class="ic-led"></span></div></div></header>
    <aside class="ic-notice"><strong>A library, with the dates attached.</strong><p>These descriptions retain their original organizations and source dates. Current openings are unverified. The Communications Lab remains an educational project desk with applications closed.</p></aside>
    <section class="ic-section" id="ic-roles"><div class="ic-heading"><div><p class="ic-label">01 / ROLE LIBRARY</p><h2>Choose a description.</h2></div><p>{catalog.counts.full} full descriptions · {catalog.counts.partial} partial.<br/>{roles.length} recovered historical role records.</p></div>
      <div class="ic-filters" data-intern-filters hidden><label>Search role records<input type="search" id="ic-search" placeholder="Role, skill or organization" /></label><label>Organization<select id="ic-organization"><option value="">All organizations</option>{organizations.map(o=><option value={o}>{o}</option>)}</select></label><label>Source depth<select id="ic-depth"><option value="">All source records</option><option value="full">Full descriptions</option><option value="partial">Partial descriptions</option><option value="title_only">Title records</option><option value="attachment_unavailable">Description unavailable</option></select></label><button id="ic-reset" type="button">Reset</button></div>
      <p class="ic-small" id="ic-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">Showing {roles.length} historical role records</p>
      <div class="ic-catalog">{roles.filter(r=>['full','partial'].includes(r.sourceDepth)).map((r,i)=><article class={`ic-cartridge ic-color-${i%4}`} data-role-card data-organization={r.organization} data-depth={r.sourceDepth} data-search={`${r.title} ${r.organization} ${r.summary} ${r.tags.join(' ')} ${r.sections.map(s=>[...(s.paragraphs||[]),...(s.items||[])].join(' ')).join(' ')}`.toLowerCase()}><div class="ic-cartridge-top"><span class="ic-number">{r.number}</span><span>{r.organization}</span></div><span class="ic-status">{r.statusLabel}</span><h3><a href={`/intern/roles/${r.slug}/`}>{r.title}</a></h3><p>{r.summary}</p><div class="ic-tags">{r.tags.map(t=><span>{t}</span>)}</div><footer><p>Source: {r.sourceDateSummary}{r.sourceDepth==='partial'&&' · partial description'}</p><a href={`/intern/roles/${r.slug}/`}>Read the description <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></footer></article>)}</div>
      <details class="ic-index" id="ic-title-index"><summary>Historical title index <span>{catalog.counts.title_only + catalog.counts.attachment_unavailable} records / full descriptions not recovered</span></summary><p>These source-dated records confirm titles and original organizations. They are included for reference; their duties and working terms have not been reconstructed. This recovered archive is not guaranteed to include every role ever posted.</p><div class="ic-index-head" aria-hidden="true"><span>File / role</span><span>Organization / source</span></div>{roles.filter(r=>!['full','partial'].includes(r.sourceDepth)).map(r=><article class="ic-index-row" data-role-card data-organization={r.organization} data-depth={r.sourceDepth} data-search={`${r.title} ${r.organization} ${r.historical_title_variants.join(' ')}`.toLowerCase()}><a href={`/intern/roles/${r.slug}/`}><span class="ic-label">{r.number}</span><strong>{r.title}</strong><small>{r.statusLabel} ↗</small></a><div><span>{r.organization}</span><p>{r.sourceDateSummary}</p><small>Full description not recovered</small></div></article>)}</details><p id="ic-empty" hidden>No role records match. Try another search or reset the filters.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="ic-section ic-lab" id="cl-experiments"><div class="ic-heading"><div><p class="ic-label">02 / COMMUNICATIONS LAB</p><h2>Make the signal useful.</h2></div><p>{lab.intro}</p></div><aside class="ic-notice"><strong>Educational project briefs · applications closed</strong><p>These are proposed explorations, not internship openings or employment offers. Pay, hours, hiring entity, supervisor, eligibility, agreements and privacy arrangements must be confirmed before a role opens. No application or work sample is requested.</p></aside><div class="ic-projects">{lab.projects.map(p=><article><p class="ic-label">{p.id} / {p.lane}</p><h3><a href={`/communications-lab/projects/${p.slug}/`}>{p.title}</a></h3><p>{p.question}</p><p class="ic-small"><strong>The proof:</strong> {p.success}</p><a href={`/communications-lab/projects/${p.slug}/`}>Open the experiment ↗</a></article>)}</div><div class="ic-actions"><a href="/communications-lab/">Full Communications Lab ↗</a><a href="/communications-lab/briefs.json">12 briefs as JSON ↗</a></div></section>
    <section class="ic-section" id="cl-desk"><p class="ic-label">03 / THE WORKING DESK</p><h2>A small team. An inspectable result.</h2><div class="ic-projects">{lab.roles.map(r=><article><p class="ic-label">{r.name}</p><h3>{r.title}</h3><p>{r.description}</p></article>)}</div><div class="ic-cadence">{lab.cadence.map(c=><article><p class="ic-label">{c.label}</p><p>{c.description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="ic-section ic-boundaries"><div><p class="ic-label">04 / THE MANUAL</p><h2>Explore freely.<br/>Publish carefully.</h2></div><ul>{lab.boundaries.map(b=><li>{b}</li>)}</ul></section>
    <section class="ic-section"><p class="ic-label">05 / HISTORICAL PROGRAMME NOTES</p><h2>Learning in earlier seasons.</h2><div class="ic-neighbors">{catalog.program_references.map(p=><article><span class="ic-status">Archived programme</span><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.description}</p></article>)}</div><p class="ic-small">Historical programme references, not current internship terms.</p></section>
    <section class="ic-section"><p class="ic-label">06 / PROPOSED SEASONS</p><div class="ic-neighbors">{lab.seasons.map(s=><article><h3>{s.label}</h3><p>{s.description}</p></article>)}</div><p>No intern work or completed experiment is represented as published here. Credited evidence can enter the shelf after contributor consent and human review.</p></section>
  </>}
  <footer class="ic-footer"><div><strong>POINTCAST / INTERN</strong><p>Read the archive. Build the next proof.</p></div><nav aria-label="Intern resources"><a href="/intern.json">Role library JSON</a><a href="/communications-lab/assets/brand-kit.zip">Lab brand kit ↓</a><a href="/communications-lab/assets/brand-guide.pdf">Lab guide ↓</a><a href="https://www.industrynext.xyz/communications-lab/">Industry Next lab ↗</a></nav><p class="ic-small">{lab.independence}<br/>Original PointCast design inspired by early console and cartridge manuals. No affiliation with or endorsement by Coleco.</p></footer>
</div>
{!role&&<script>
  import { setupInternFilters } from '../lib/intern-filters.mjs';
  setupInternFilters(document);
</script>}
